      "dcterms:title": "Inactivated in-house CCHFV slide",
      "dcterms:description": "In-house IF-slides to detect anti-CCHFV antibodies by Immunofluorecence assay. The slides were prepared by infecting Vero cells with the CCHFV strain, Nigerian IbAr10200. The slides are fixated in acetone, air-dried and preserved at -80°C. The slide has been tested positive with mouse monoclonal anti-CCHFV antibodies against N, Gc and Gn.",
