      "dcterms:title": "Institut Pasteur Paris - Management of biosafety and biosecurity in BSL3 containment facilities. The access will comprise a detailed theoretical and, subject to availability, practical application of the biosafety and biosecurity management of BSL3 in Ins",
      "dcterms:description": "Institut Pasteur Paris - Access to BSL 3 containment facility. The access will comprise a detailed theoretical and subject to availability practical application of the biosafety and biosecurity management at Institut Pasteur. Among others, establishment and validation of suitable decontamination methods for waist, rooms and material, as well as documentation and information management will be addressed.",
