      "dcterms:modified": "2018-07-11T15:05:30+02:00",
      "dcterms:title": "Institut Pasteur Paris - PCR workflow and typing for rabies virus and other lyssaviruses ",
      "dcterms:description": "Institut Pasteur Paris - In this 2 weeks course the basic principles of routine virus typing will be addressed by a combination of lectures, demonstration and hands-on training. Participants will perform all required laboratory and analysis procedures for routine typing of lyssaviruses: Special attention will be given to quality control and assay validation. Topics included: sample preparation, nucleic acid extraction - reverse transcription and PCR (conventional a,nd RT-qPCR) - assay validation and quality control - Sequencing and sequence analysis - Basic phylogeny for virus typing - assay validation and quality control.",
      "EVORAO:unitDefinition": "2 weeks",
      "EVORAO:category": {
        "@type": "EVORAO:ProductCategory",
        "dcterms:title": "service"
